ct = AND tất cả checks (lỗi + fail_on_error=false thì bỏ qua).\n• deny=true & verdict=false → 446 + hook_results.\n• async chỉ log.", "originalText": "💬 Verdict (hooks/index.ts:420).\n• verdict = AND tất cả checks (lỗi + fail_on_error=false thì bỏ qua).\n• deny=true & verdict=false → 446 + hook_results.\n• async chỉ log.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 83}, {"id": "c13_b", "type": "rectangle", "x": 830, "y": 1190, "width": 360, "height": 85, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#795548", "backgroundColor": "#fffde7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "boundElements": [], "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "c13", "type": "text", "x": 838, "y": 1196, "width": 344, "height": 73, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4e342e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "💬 Response.\n• Trả response gốc / đã redact, hoặc 446 khi bị deny.\n• Log request/response/hook_results để audit.", "originalText": "💬 Response.\n• Trả response gốc / đã redact, hoặc 446 khi bị deny.\n• Log request/response/hook_results để audit.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 73}], "files": {}, "source": "https://excalidraw.com", "type": "excalidraw", "version": 2}